  ],
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "$id": "urn:obtainer:device-profile:2",
  "title": "OBTAINER inspection-only OS profile schema 2",
  "description": "Structural schema. Rust validation also enforces 64 KiB, depth 16, collection 64, strings 1024 bytes, unique keys, exact sub-capability keys, referenced evidence, calendar dates, explicit firmware schemes and application-owned adapter state. Firmware scheme defaults to legacy numeric_triplet; opaque_exact permits only literal exact versions without ranges. Validation never grants trust. Schema 2 requires inspectionOnly=true and UNKNOWN hardware feature assessments. Rust additionally enforces an exact OpenWrt release, compound board/target/build identity, absent manufacturer/revision claims and no verified feature ranges. This schema does not authorize a connection or activate a profile."
}
